{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10138020","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10138020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"subtitle:2:1013803001:":{"text":"땅이 진동하고 있어요! 다들 조심하세요!","source_cn":"是地面在震动！大家小心站稳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E998AD36C251E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013802001:0":{"text":"여러분, 걸음을 멈춰주세요. 앞쪽에서 중요한 의식을 진행하고 있으니 방해해서는 안 돼요.","source_cn":"诸位，请止步。前方在举行重要的仪式，不能被打扰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8D5FF72F6CBF13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013802002:0":{"text":"보아하니 성물과 관련된 의식을 치르고 계신 것 같네요. 듀라께서 계시니, 성기사 테미히아 명을 받고...","source_cn":"看来，你们在举行与圣物有关的仪式。艾雅在上，圣骑士特弥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9960143F5065B55E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013802003:0":{"text":"잠깐만요. 지면 위에 미아즈마로 자욱한 균열은 어떻게 된 거죠?","source_cn":"等等，地面上这道黑雾弥漫的裂隙是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80AD4A33D590F215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013802004:0":{"text":"중간에 빛나는 저 돌이 바로 우리가 보호해야 하는 성물인가요? 대체 무슨 의식을 진행하고 있는 거죠?","source_cn":"中间这块发光的石头，就是咱们要保护的圣物吗？这到底是在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31DC8F04926F56C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013802005:0":{"text":"테미히아, 이런 의식을 본 적...","source_cn":"特弥希娅， 你可曾见过这样的仪——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x403098D84095E7CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013802006:0":{"text":"이 빛나는 돌은... 성석이야...","source_cn":"这块发光的石头……是圣石……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE5788C305643EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013802007:0":{"text":"하지만 성석은 아탈란... 어쨌든, 행방불명 아닌가요?","source_cn":"可是，圣石不是被阿塔兰……总之，下落不明了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x848FDA795540728F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013802008:2":{"text":"게다가 테미히아... 네 가슴이 빛나고 있어! 너..","source_cn":"而且，特弥希娅……你的胸口在发光！你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5795CF46B023D0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1013802009:0":{"text":"그건 우선 제쳐두고! 이봐! 수도사, 이 아래에 시커먼 균열은 대체 어떻게 된 거야?","source_cn":"先别管那个了！喂！修士，下面这道黑乎乎的裂隙到底是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B58D9611D299459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_ti